nges to show the outdoor plaza with stalls. This indicates they are **beginning to move** from their stationary position at B1 towards the outdoor area.\n    *   **Frames 20-30** show them walking or standing in the outdoor plaza area, with the stalls visible in the background. They are no longer at the B1 sign.\n\n    **Conclusion:** The frames do not show them actively descending stairs or escalators. The transition from being stationary at the B1 level (Frames 5-18) to being in the outdoor plaza (Frames 20-30) happens between **Frame 18 and Frame 19**. Frame 19 is the first frame where they are clearly moving away from the B1 sign towards the plaza. The descent itself is not captured in these frames; we only see them *after* they have presumably come up from B1 and are now moving into the plaza area.\n\n2.  **Locate the FIRST booth/stall they stop at immediately after descending:**\n    *   After Frame 19 (the transition), in **Frame 20**, they are walking through the outdoor plaza. In the background, several stalls are visible, including one with a red canopy and claw machines (commonly associated with games or prizes, not food).\n    *   In **Frame 21**, the vlogger on the left points towards the stalls in the background. The stall he is pointing at is the one with the red canopy and claw machines. They are still walking and not stationary.\n    *   **Frames 22-30** show them stopping again, but this time they are back inside, standing near the same B1 sign area as in Frames 5-18. They are not in front of any specific outdoor stall.\n\n    **Conclusion:** The frames do not show them stopping in front of *any* specific booth or stall *after* leaving the B1 level. They walk through the plaza (Frames 20-21) and then return to the indoor area near the B1 sign (Frames 22-30). There is **no frame where they are stationary in front of a specific booth** immediately after their implied ascent from B1.\n\n3.  **Examine what type of booth/stall it is:**\n    *   Since they do not stop at any specific booth, it is impossible to examine its type, signage, or products.\n\n4.  **Check if any of the answer choices match:**\n    *   The answer choices are: A. Fried Rice Cake, B. North Korean dagao, C. Thailand milk tea, D. Fried yogurt.\n    *   None of these specific food items or their associated signage are visible in any of the frames. The only stall clearly visible (in Frames 20-21) has claw machines, which is not related to any of the food options listed.\n\n5.  **Pay attention to temporal sequence - what happens immediately after descending stairs:**\n    *   As established, the descent is not shown. Immediately after being stationary at the B1 sign (Frame 18), they begin moving towards the plaza (Frame 19), walk through it (Frames 20-21), and then return to the indoor area (Frames 22-30). They do not stop at a booth.\n\n6.  **Look for any text/signage that might indicate the booth type:**\n    *   No signage for any food stall is legible or visible in the frames provided. The only clear signage is the "B1" sign.\n\n7.  **Note if the vloggers are stationary in front of a specific booth:**\n    *   **No.** They are only stationary in front of the B1 sign (Frames 5-18, 22-30) or walking through the plaza (Frames 19-21). They are never shown stationary in front of a specific market stall or booth.\n\n**Final Determination:**\n\nBased on the provided 30 frames, **it is not possible to determine which booth the vloggers stop in front of first after coming downstairs from the B1 floor**. The frames do not capture the descent, and crucially, they do not show the vloggers stopping in front of *any* specific booth or stall after leaving the B1 level. They walk through the plaza but do not pause at a stall before returning to the indoor area.\n\nTherefore, **none of the answer choices (A, B, C, D) can be confirmed as correct based on the available visual evidence.** The necessary event (stopping at a booth) simply does not occur in these frames.'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1485.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1486.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1487.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1488.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1489.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1490.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1491.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1492.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1493.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1494.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1495.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1496.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1497.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1498.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1499.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1500.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1501.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1502.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1503.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1504.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1505.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1555.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1556.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1557.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1558.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processe